        if (timer !== null) {
            clearTimeout(timer);
        }
        timer = setTimeout(() => {
            timer = null; // clear timer when it fires
            fn(args);
        }, waitMs);
    };
}
```

This way:
1. New call arrives → cancel previous timer, schedule new one
2. Timer fires → set timer = null, then call fn with latest args
3. After firing, timer is null, so next call will schedule a new timer

